  "metadata": {
    "title": "A comprehensive dataset of chloride thresholds and electrochemical parameters for steel rebar corrosion in cementitious environments",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21987599",
    "publication_date": "2026-08-18",
    "description": "<p>This dataset is a centralized, comprehensive collection of chloride threshold values and electrochemical parameters for steel rebar corrosion in cementitious environments, compiled from peer-reviewed published literature and experimental datasets. The dataset includes steel and cementitious-material information, simulated concrete pore-solution composition, CT values, corrosion potential (E<sub>cp</sub>), pitting potential (E<sub>b</sub>), pH, exposure conditions, and associated source information.</p>",
